0000 - YOU CAN PUSH THE CARRIAGES IN ORDER TO HIDE BEHIND THEM 
0001
0002 - TO BLOW UP THE ARMOURED CARRIAGES, PLACE SEVERAL BARRELS OF EXPLOSIVES
0003   TOGETHER WITH THE BOMBS
0004
0005 - PLACE TWO BUNDLES OF EXPLOSIVES TO BLOW UP THE RAIL GUN 
0006
0007 - TO ESCAPE, USE THE LOCOMOTIVE STOPPED ON THE FIRST TRACK 
